WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.296
Watch and read: Ama asks: In a dictionary, the word “garden” means:

00:00:05.117 --> 00:00:09.682
The answer is: land where plants grow. A dictionary gives the meanings of words.

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:14.992
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which source can help you check how “garden” is spelt?

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:19.835
The answer is: A dictionary. Dictionaries help with spelling and meaning.
